---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout title="Privacy Policy - PasteDownloadApp" description="Privacy Policy for PasteDownloadApp. Your privacy matters. All image processing happens in your browser with zero uploads to our servers." canonicalUrl="https://pastedownloadapp.com/privacy/">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://pastedownloadapp.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Privacy Policy", "item": "https://pastedownloadapp.com/privacy/" }
      ]
    }
  </script>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "Privacy Policy - PasteDownloadApp",
      "description": "Privacy Policy for PasteDownloadApp. All image processing happens in your browser with zero uploads to our servers.",
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "PasteDownloadApp"
      }
    }
  </script>

  <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-[28px] font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight mt-0 mb-6 leading-tight text-balance">
    Privacy Policy
  </h1>

  <div class="text-body text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 [&_h2]:text-ink [&_h2]:text-lg [&_h2]:sm:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:mt-8 [&_h2]:mb-2 [&_h2]:leading-tight [&_h3]:text-ink [&_h3]:text-base [&_h3]:sm:text-lg [&_h3]:font-semibold [&_h3]:tracking-tight [&_h3]:mt-6 [&_h3]:mb-2 [&_h3]:leading-tight [&_a]:text-link [&_a]:underline [&_a]:underline-offset-2 [&_a]:decoration-link/30 [&_a]:transition-colors [&_a:hover]:decoration-link">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> June 2026</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      PasteDownloadApp is designed with your privacy as our top priority. Our tool processes all images entirely within your browser using the <strong>Clipboard API</strong> and <strong>Canvas API</strong>. We do <strong>not</strong> collect, store, transmit, or have access to any images you paste, upload, or download through our service.
    </p>
    <p>
      When you use the URL download feature, image data is fetched directly by your browser and processed client-side. No image data is routed through or stored on our servers at any point.
    </p>

    <h2>No Data Collection</h2>
    <p>
      We do not use cookies, tracking scripts, analytics, or any form of data collection technology. We do not collect personal information such as your name, email address, IP address, or browsing behavior.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      Our website uses <strong>Google Fonts</strong> for typography. When you load the page, your browser requests font files from Google's servers, which may log your IP address according to Google's privacy policy. We use a <code>preconnect</code> and <code>preload</code> strategy to minimize the impact of this request.
    </p>
    <p>
      No other third-party scripts, embeds, or services are used on this website.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      Since we do not collect any personal data or image data, there is nothing to retain. All processing is ephemeral and occurs entirely in your browser session. Once you close or refresh the page, no data persists.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      Because we collect no personal data, there is no data to access, correct, delete, or port. If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
    </p>
  </div>
</ContentLayout>
